    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I have started doing in #63:\n\n```\nsetIndex={setIndex}\n\n// .. later on\n\nfunction setIndex(helper, indexName) {\n  helper.setIndex().search();\n}\n```\n\nSo that the component only knows about setIndex and do not have do do the search itself.\n\nWhat do you think?\n\nhttps://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blob/feat/menu-1st-version/widgets/menu.js#L57-L70\n",
